# The web image's configuration (copy to web.env). Not secret: these values
# end up in public files. APP_ORIGIN comes from APP_DOMAIN in server.env
# (compose.yaml). Every variable: docs/environment.md#web-variables.
#
# The app's identity, for the files that let the phones open https://<domain>/app/*
# links in the app (/.well-known/apple-app-site-association and
# /.well-known/assetlinks.json). Each pair is set together or not at all; unset,
# that file answers 404 and the phones open the links in the browser, on the
# open-in-app page. The values of the production variant of the app
# (apps/mobile/app.config.ts), whose APP.linkDomain is APP_DOMAIN.
#
# The Team ID of the Apple Developer account (10 characters) and the bundle
# identifier.
# APPLE_TEAM_ID=ABCDE12345
# IOS_BUNDLE_ID=com.example.templateapp
# The application id, and the SHA-256 fingerprints of the certificates that
# sign the app (Play Console > Test and release > App integrity: the app
# signing key, and the upload key for builds installed outside Play), in
# capitals, comma separated.
# ANDROID_PACKAGE=com.example.templateapp
# ANDROID_SHA256_CERT_FINGERPRINTS=AB:CD:...
